   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Children and Teens&apos; Education at risk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At PACO IAP, Childrens Home, we are committed to the well-being and future of the children and teenagers who call our institution their home. Having successfully provided comprehensive care, we are excited to introduce our educational project aimed at securing a quality education for them. Our goal is to equip these children and adolescents with the necessary tools and unwavering support to help them realize their academic and personal potential. Together we can make it possible.</narrative>
